{"title":"Astronaut Don Pettit&#8217;s Marvelous Photos From Space","link":"https://kottke.org/25/05/astronaut-don-pettits-marvelous-photos-from-space","date":1747259323000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/don-pettit-iss.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/don-pettit-iss.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/don-pettit-iss.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1733\" alt=\"a photo taken from the ISS with the Milky Way visible over an intensely colored sunrise\" /></p>\n\n<p>The NY Times has <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/12/science/don-pettit-photos-nasa-astronaut.html?unlocked_article_code=1.G08.N4dK.yi0JQYCok0-x\">a nice feature on NASA astronaut Don Pettit’s photography</a> from his latest stay in space, a 220-day mission aboard the ISS.</p>\n\n<p>Now, you know I like a good astronomical image (like the one above of an ISS sunrise), but the thing that really caught my eye was <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rbzBkcXXttI\">the video</a> of Pettit’s experiment involving charged water droplets and a teflon needle:</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p>I could watch that allllll day long.</p>\n\n<p>More Pettit: <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/05/swirling-green-aurora-captured-from-the-iss\">Swirling Green Aurora Captured From the ISS</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/astronomy\">astronomy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Don%20Pettit\">Don Pettit</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/science\">science</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/space\">space</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/video\">video</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/05/astronaut-don-pettits-marvelous-photos-from-space\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"dcb68a332986d499b5a52e9b8dea7f2f793cd1a373d8a70d2a76fe8194a7a1e7","category":"Sites"}